{"id": "ledgar/test/4018", "source": "ledgar", "primitive": "choice", "split": "test", "state": "\"Schedule 5.13 shows, for each Loan Party and each Subsidiary, its name and its jurisdiction of organization. Schedule 5.13 shows , for each Subsidiary of the Borrower, its authorized and issued Equity Interests, the holders of its Equity Interests, and all agreements binding on such holders with respect to their Equity Interests. Except as disclosed on Schedule 5.13 , in the five years preceding the Closing Date, neither the Borrower nor any Subsidiary has acquired any substantial assets from any other Person nor been the surviving entity in a merger, amalgamation or combination. The Borrower has good title to its Equity Interests in its Subsidiaries, and all such Equity Interests are duly issued, fully paid and non-assessable. There are no outstanding purchase options, warrants, subscription rights, agreements to issue or sell, convertible interests, phantom rights or powers of attorney relating to Equity Interests of any Subsidiary of the Borrower.\"", "question": "{\"type\": \"choice\", \"instructions\": \"Which contract provision category does this clause belong to?\", \"criteria\": {\"Adjustments\": null, \"Agreements\": null, \"Amendments\": null, \"Anti-Corruption Laws\": null, \"Applicable Laws\": null, \"Approvals\": null, \"Arbitration\": null, \"Assignments\": null, \"Assigns\": null, \"Authority\": null, \"Authorizations\": null, \"Base Salary\": null, \"Benefits\": null, \"Binding Effects\": null, \"Books\": null, \"Brokers\": null, \"Capitalization\": null, \"Change In Control\": null, \"Closings\": null, \"Compliance With Laws\": null, \"Confidentiality\": null, \"Consent To Jurisdiction\": null, \"Consents\": null, \"Construction\": null, \"Cooperation\": null, \"Costs\": null, \"Counterparts\": null, \"Death\": null, \"Defined Terms\": null, \"Definitions\": null, \"Disability\": null, \"Disclosures\": null, \"Duties\": null, \"Effective Dates\": null,